        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, mixed demolition, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, mixed demolition, at plant
This is a multi output process of mixed demolition entering the recycling plant. An economic allocation is applied between the disposal service of mixed demolition and the recycling product RC-M;
UUID: d25c4b44-285d-4122-8a63-f271628e14f1
Includes the infrastructure, energy demand and waste of the recycling process of mixed demolition
Location: Data from Eberhard AG, Switzerland
Technology: dry processing, stationary crusher
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d25c4b44-285d-4122-8a63-f271628e14f1.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
